{
  "title": "Ziyaarat-e-Jaamea'h Sagheerah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اَوْلِیَآءِ اللهِ وَ اَصْفِیَآئِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A’LAA AWLEYAAA-ILLAAHE WA ASFEYAAA-EHI \nPeace be on the sincere adherents of Allah, who are also His exceptional favourites, \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اُمَنَآءِ اللهِ وَ اَحِبَّآئِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A'LAA OMANAAA-IL LAAHE WA AHIBBAAA-EHI \nPeace be on the trustees of Allah, who are also His dearest friends.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اَنْصَارِ اللهِ وَ خُلَفَآئِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A'LAA ANSAARIL LAAHE WA KHOLAFAAA-EHI \nPeace be on the supporters of Allah, who are also His representatives.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی مَحَآلِّ مَعْرِفَۃِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A'LAA MAHAAALLE MAA'-REFATIL LAAHE \nPeace be on the medium of the awareness of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی مَسَاكِنِ ذِكْرِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A'LAA MASAAKENE ZIKRIL LAAHE \nPeace be on the centre of the remembrance of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی مُظْهِرِیْ اَمْرِ اللّٰهِ وَ نَهْیِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A'LAA MUZHEREE AMRIL LAAHE WA NAHYEHI \nPeace be on (you) who make clear His lawful and unlawful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الدُّعَاۃِ اِلَی اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A'LAD DO-A'ATE ELAL LAAHE \nPeace be on (you) who invite mankind unto Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْمُسْتَقِرِّیْنَ فِیْ مَرْضَاۃِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A'LAL MUSTAQIRREENA FEE MARZAATIL LAAHE \nPeace be on (you) who occupy and supervise the centre through which Allah’s pleasure is routed.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْمُخْلِصِیْنَ فِیْ طَاعَۃِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A'LAL MUKHLESEENA FEE TAA-A'TIL LAAHE \nPeace be on (you) who truly obey and serve Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْاَدِلَّآءِ عَلَی اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A'LAL A-DILLAAA-E A'LAL LAAHE \nPeace be on (you) who show the right path leading unto Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الَّذِیْنَ مَنْ وَ الَاهُمْ فَقَدْ وَالَی اللهَ\nASSALAAMO A'LAL LAZEENA MAN WAALAAHUM FAQAD WAALAL LAAHA \nPeace be on (you) whom whoso befriends, in fact, makes friends with Allah, \nوَ مَنْ عَادَاهُمْ فَقَدْ عَادَی اللهَ \nWA MAN A'ADAAHUM FAQAD A'ADAL LAAHA \nwhom whoso opposes, in fact, runs counter to Allah, \nوَ مَنْ عَرَفَهُمْ فَقَدْ عَرَفَ اللهَ \nWA MAN A'RAFAHUM FAQAD A'RAFAL LAAHA \nwhom whoso understands, in fact, recognises Allah,\nوَ مَنْ جَهِلَهُمْ فَقَدْ جَهِلَ اللهَ\nWA MAN JAHELAHUM FAQAD JAHELAL LAAHA \nwhom whoso passes over, in fact, ignores Allah, \nوَ مَنِ اعْتَصَمَ بِهِمْ فَقَدِ اعْتَصَمَ بِاللّٰهِ\nWA MANE'-TASAMA BEHIM FAQADE'-TASAMA BILLAAHE \nwhom whoso defends, in fact, supports Allah,\nوَ مَنْ تَخَلّٰی مِنْهُمْ فَقَدْ تَخَلّٰی مِنَ اللهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ \nWA MAN TAKHALLAA MINHUM FAQAD TAKHALLAA MENAL LAAHE A'ZZA WA JALLA \nwhom whoso deserts, in fact, abandons the Almighty Allah.\nوَاُشْهِدُ اللهَ اَنِّیْ سِلْمٌ لِمَنْ سَالَمْتُمْ \nWA USH-HEDUL LAAHA ANNEE SILMUN LEMAN SAALAMTUM \nI request Allah to vouch for me that I make peace with those who are at peace with you, \nوَ حَرْبٌ لِمَنْ حَارَبْتُمْ مُؤْمِنٌ بِسِرِّكُمْ وَعَلَانِیَتِكُمْ \nWA HARBUN LEMAN HAARABTUM MOMENUN BE-SIRREKUM WA A'LAANEYATEKUM \nI make war upon those who declare war on you, I believe in that which is concealed and in that which is evident concerning you, \nمُفَوِّضٌ فِیْ ذٰلِكَ كُلِّهٖ اِلَیْكُمْ \nMOFAWWEZUN FEE ZAALEKA KULLEHI ELAYKUM\nI give total control of my affairs in your hands.\nلَعَنَ اللهُ عَدُوَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ مِنَ الْجِنِّ وَالْاِنْسِ \nLA-A'NAL LAAHO A'DUWWA AALE MOHAMMADIN MENAL JINNE WAL INSE \nMay Allah curse the enemies of Progeny of Muhammad, be they jinn or men, \nوَ اَبْرَءُ اِلَی اللّٰهِ مِنْهُمْ وَ صَلَّی اللهٌ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِهٖ.\nWA ABRA-O WA SALLALLAAHO A'LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI\nI disconnect all links with them and turn to Allah, and Allah's blessings be on Muhammad and on his children."
}
